  "Immediately give all allies 1 stack of $1 DEF + $2/$3/$4 (Change when reaching level 1, 50, 70) Shield as <link\\=\"s|201\"><u>[Upright Mark]</u></link> and 1 stack of <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color> DEF + <color\\=#FFFC40>$6</color> Shield as <link\\=\"s|203\"><u>[Holy Protection]</u></link>, give all allies 1 Down Points and increase their damage by ($8 for every $7 DEF you have, up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$9</color>) for $10 turns.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>A wall of ice rises up from the ground, cutting off the noise of the battlefield and deflecting all arrows from foes.</color></size></b>": "",
  "[HIGHLIGHT]: Immediately give all allies 1 stack of <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> DEF + <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> Shield as <link\\=\"s|203\"><u>[Holy Protection]</u></link>, decrease all allies' DMG Taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> for $4 turns. \\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Ice damage to 1 foe. \\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe. \\nGun Attack: Deal Gun damage to 1 foe. Can fire until out of ammo.": "",
